    "detailed_description": "<h1>ADD TO WISHLIST!</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899350/extras/bdc9ae58d89286da3b8a8154b2acf6a9.avif?t=1755135833\" width=600 height=550 /></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Welcome to the demons world! I don't know how you managed to get here, but it was a stupid idea on your part. It's a shame your brother was taken by demons, but do you really think you'll be able to find him? Is it really worth it? Well, it's none of my business. All you have to do is explore this wonderful world, and who knows, maybe you'll survive or even meet someone.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899350/extras/13781aea951ec2839568b8f721e4bad8.poster.avif?t=1755135833\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899350/extras/13781aea951ec2839568b8f721e4bad8.webm?t=1755135833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899350/extras/13781aea951ec2839568b8f721e4bad8.mp4?t=1755135833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>- 3D action platformer metroidvania!<br>- The character visually changes with every upgrades you find!<br>- As many as 8 locations to explore<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899350/extras/7fea39cc3103014c44b1d76645767376.poster.avif?t=1755135833\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899350/extras/7fea39cc3103014c44b1d76645767376.webm?t=1755135833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899350/extras/7fea39cc3103014c44b1d76645767376.mp4?t=1755135833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>- Responsive controls<br>- Coolest retro visual style<br>- Variety of mobs on the locations<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899350/extras/b37cdd8edf9c2141a4304441f833ff60.poster.avif?t=1755135833\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899350/extras/b37cdd8edf9c2141a4304441f833ff60.webm?t=1755135833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899350/extras/b37cdd8edf9c2141a4304441f833ff60.mp4?t=1755135833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>- Many secrets to find<br>- Different types of upgrades<br>- Ability to collect pets<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899350/extras/83b8272c75ae3f568757f3d4e7a4fb04.poster.avif?t=1755135833\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899350/extras/83b8272c75ae3f568757f3d4e7a4fb04.webm?t=1755135833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899350/extras/83b8272c75ae3f568757f3d4e7a4fb04.mp4?t=1755135833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>- Purchasing of customization items for player and pets from the merchant (skins, hats).<br>- Excellent optimization<br>- Full support for gamepad and steamdeck controls</h2></strong>",
    "about_the_game": "Welcome to the demons world! I don't know how you managed to get here, but it was a stupid idea on your part. It's a shame your brother was taken by demons, but do you really think you'll be able to find him? Is it really worth it? Well, it's none of my business. All you have to do is explore this wonderful world, and who knows, maybe you'll survive or even meet someone.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899350/extras/13781aea951ec2839568b8f721e4bad8.poster.avif?t=1755135833\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899350/extras/13781aea951ec2839568b8f721e4bad8.webm?t=1755135833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899350/extras/13781aea951ec2839568b8f721e4bad8.mp4?t=1755135833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>- 3D action platformer metroidvania!<br>- The character visually changes with every upgrades you find!<br>- As many as 8 locations to explore<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899350/extras/7fea39cc3103014c44b1d76645767376.poster.avif?t=1755135833\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899350/extras/7fea39cc3103014c44b1d76645767376.webm?t=1755135833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899350/extras/7fea39cc3103014c44b1d76645767376.mp4?t=1755135833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>- Responsive controls<br>- Coolest retro visual style<br>- Variety of mobs on the locations<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899350/extras/b37cdd8edf9c2141a4304441f833ff60.poster.avif?t=1755135833\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899350/extras/b37cdd8edf9c2141a4304441f833ff60.webm?t=1755135833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899350/extras/b37cdd8edf9c2141a4304441f833ff60.mp4?t=1755135833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>- Many secrets to find<br>- Different types of upgrades<br>- Ability to collect pets<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899350/extras/83b8272c75ae3f568757f3d4e7a4fb04.poster.avif?t=1755135833\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899350/extras/83b8272c75ae3f568757f3d4e7a4fb04.webm?t=1755135833\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2899350/extras/83b8272c75ae3f568757f3d4e7a4fb04.mp4?t=1755135833\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>- Purchasing of customization items for player and pets from the merchant (skins, hats).<br>- Excellent optimization<br>- Full support for gamepad and steamdeck controls</h2></strong>",
